              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "Tumor Control"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "CCNU (60–70 mg/m2PO every 3 weeks) or",
              "pdf_page": 211,
              "printed_page": 129,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "Tumor Control"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "temozolomide (100–120 mg/m2PO q24h for",
