              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "Tumor Control"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "q24h) may be effective in reducing peritumoral",
              "pdf_page": 211,
              "printed_page": 129,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "Tumor Control"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "edema and improving neurologic signs. Patients",
              "pdf_page": 211,
              "printed_page": 129,
              "column": 2,
              "subheading": "Tumor Control"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
